{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":205,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"30e5772e-ca94-40cc-9232-0f798db73fab","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351508266,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"系统应用工程师(多相控制器)(J10661)","OrgId":1417750,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"参与市场调研，了解市场动态，以重点客户牵引规划产品路标，向市场提供可行性方案；\n• 具有市场竞争力的产品设计定义；\n• 和设计团队一起跟踪和维护芯片产品在开发和量产过程中的问题；\n• 参与撰写产品规格书、应用设计手册；\n• 系统评估测试及客户关键疑难点技术支持；\n• 提供技术支持和技术培训；\n• 完成领导安排的其他工作；","Require":"电子电力相关专业，本科或硕士（优选）以上学历，具备一定的的电力电子专业理论知识；\n• 5年+多相控制器，computing power,pc,POL,AI服务器电源，efuse,drmos相关领域的工作经历优先；\n• 能够根据客户需求，独立完成从拓扑选择、控制环路设计、仿真验证到测试验证整个流程；\n• 至少熟练掌握一种常用电力电子仿真软件，例如simplis、LTspice、saber等；\n• 可适应一定的差旅安排；\n• 良好的英语书面和口头表达能力；\n• 具备较强的自我驱动力、责任心和学习能力；\n• 较好的团队协作和沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-11-03T09:39:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"aea6dcb4-a34b-4f